
name: Nes Feature Request
description: Submit a request for a new feature or an improvement to existing functionality.
title: "[Feature Request] "

body:
  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ## 1. General Information
        Please provide any relevant information about the feature request.
        All fields are optional.

  - type: input
    id: feature_title
    attributes:
      label: Feature / Request Title
      description: Short and descriptive title for the request.
      placeholder: e.g. Improve camera selection functionality

  - type: input
    id: sport_product_platform
    attributes:
      label: Sport / Product / Platform
      description: Which sport, product, or platform is affected?
      placeholder: e.g. Football, Virtual Director, Platform

  - type: input
    id: target_date
    attributes:
      label: Target Date
      description: When is this feature ideally needed?
      placeholder: "YYYY-MM-DD"

  - type: input
    id: customer
    attributes:
      label: Customer
      description: Customer or prospect related to this request.
      placeholder: Customer name

  - type: input
    id: request_owner
    attributes:
      label: Request Owner
      description: Person responsible for submitting or following up on this request.
      placeholder: Name

  - type: dropdown
    id: priority
    attributes:
      label: Priority
      description: Indicate the requested priority.
      options:
        - Low
        - Medium
        - High
        - Critical

  - type: textarea
    id: reason_for_request
    attributes:
      label: Reason for Request
      description: Why is this request needed?
      placeholder: Describe the reason for this request.

  - type: input
    id: amount_of_requesters
    attributes:
      label: Amount of Requesters
      description: Number of people, customers, or teams requesting this feature. To be completed internally.
      placeholder: Filled in internally

  - type: dropdown
    id: request_type
    attributes:
      label: Request Type
      description: Select the type that best describes this request.
      options:
        - New feature / functionality
        - Improvement to existing functionality
        - Feature on Virtual Director functionality
        - Integration / API
        - Automation / workflow improvement
        - Performance / scalability
        - Other

  - type: dropdown
    id: virtual_director_version
    attributes:
      label: Virtual Director Version
      description: If this request concerns Virtual Director functionality, select the relevant version.
      options:
        - VD Pro
        - VD Regular
        - VD Portable
        - Not applicable
        - Other

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        ## 2. Problem & Functional Requirements

  - type: textarea
    id: problem_to_solve
    attributes:
      label: What Problem Are We Trying to Solve?
      description: Describe the problem or opportunity.
      placeholder: What problem are we trying to solve?

  - type: textarea
    id: current_situation
    attributes:
      label: Current Situation / Existing Workflow
      description: Explain how the process or functionality currently works.
      placeholder: Describe the current situation or workflow.

  - type: textarea
    id: missing_functionality
    attributes:
      label: What Is Missing or Not Working as Expected?
      description: Describe the limitations, gaps, or issues.
      placeholder: What is missing or not working as expected?

  - type: textarea
    id: requested_functionality
    attributes:
      label: Requested Functionality / Proposed Improvement
      description: Describe the requested feature or improvement.
      placeholder: What would you like to see implemented?

  - type: textarea
    id: expected_behaviour
    attributes:
      label: Expected Behaviour / Desired Outcome
      description: Explain how the feature should work and what the result should be.
      placeholder: Describe the expected behaviour or outcome.

  - type: textarea
    id: target_users
    attributes:
      label: Who Will Use This Feature?
      description: Identify the intended users, customers, or internal teams.
      placeholder: Describe the target users.

  - type: textarea
    id: use_cases
    attributes:
      label: Main Use Cases / User Scenarios
      description: Provide examples of when and how the feature would be used.
      placeholder: Describe the main use cases or user scenarios.

  - type: dropdown
    id: feature_scope
    attributes:
      label: New Feature or Extension?
      description: Indicate whether this is new functionality or an extension of existing functionality.
      options:
        - Completely new feature
        - Extension of existing functionality
        - Improvement or modification of existing functionality
        - Not sure yet

  - type: textarea
    id: references
    attributes:
      label: Examples, Screenshots, Mock-ups or Reference Links
      description: Add any supporting information that helps explain the request.
      placeholder: Paste links or describe relevant examples.

  - type: textarea
    id: additional_requirements
    attributes:
      label: Additional Requirements or Constraints
      description: Include any other relevant requirements, limitations, or considerations.
      placeholder: Additional information

  - type: markdown
    attributes:
      value: |
        ---
        ## 3. Business / Sales

  - type: input
    id: customer_prospect
    attributes:
      label: Customer / Prospect
      description: Which customer or prospect is associated with this request?
      placeholder: Customer or prospect name

  - type: dropdown
    id: customer_status
    attributes:
      label: Customer Status
      description: Is this a new or existing customer?
      options:
        - New customer
        - Existing customer
        - Prospect
        - Internal request
        - Other

  - type: dropdown
    id: contract_deal_related
    attributes:
      label: Contract / Deal Related?
      description: Is this request linked to a contract, renewal, or commercial deal?
      options:
        - Yes
        - No
        - To be confirmed

  - type: textarea
    id: revenue_potential
    attributes:
      label: Revenue Potential
      description: Describe the expected revenue opportunity, if known.
      placeholder: Expected revenue or commercial opportunity

  - type: textarea
    id: expected_scale
    attributes:
      label: Expected Number of Users / Teams / Matches
      description: Estimate the expected usage or scale of the feature.
      placeholder: Number of users, teams, matches, or locations

  - type: input
    id: target_market
    attributes:
      label: Target Market / League / Competition
      description: Which market, league, or competition is relevant?
      placeholder: e.g. National leagues, amateur football

  - type: dropdown
    id: strategic_importance
    attributes:
      label: Strategic Importance
      description: How important is this request strategically?
      options:
        - Low
        - Medium
        - High
        - Critical
        - To be assessed

  - type: dropdown
    id: reusability
    attributes:
      label: Customer-Specific or Reusable?
      description: Can this feature be used by other customers as well?
      options:
        - Customer-specific
        - Reusable for multiple customers
        - Potentially reusable
        - To be assessed

  - type: textarea
    id: business_justification
    attributes:
      label: Why Is This Feature Needed to Win or Retain the Customer?
      description: Explain the commercial value and the impact on customer acquisition or retention.
      placeholder: Describe why this feature matters for winning or retaining the customer.
